Dear Sir or Madam,

=20

I attach Day 2 of a serialised public record relating to Judicial Review AC=
-2025-LON-004293.

=20

The document, The Suppressed Clinical Evidence, places before each recipien=
t a single documentary fact, verifiable by direct comparison between two doc=
uments already on the record: the letter of Dr Leigh Poyser MBBS MRCPsych da=
ted 26 March 2025, and the judgment of MacDonald J dated 8 May 2025.

=20

The accompanying Primary Statement of Harm (18 March 2026) sets out the und=
erlying legal framework. The Accountability Map identifies the institutional=
 and individual recipients now placed on notice of this record.

=20

Further statements in this serialized public record will follow.

=20

Yours faithfully,

Nadia Zahmoul Litigant in Person nadia@rosekross.com=20

Public archive: https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Public-=
Archive

=20

